Read PROJECT_SPEC.md and DESIGN_SPEC.md first before writing or modifying any code. DESIGN_SPEC.md takes precedence on visual design.
Work ONE stage at a time as defined in PROJECT_SPEC.md (Section 11) and DESIGN_SPEC.md (Section 7).
After each stage, stop, summarize what changed, and explain how to test it. Do not start the next stage until the owner says "davom et".
Code, identifiers, file names, and comments must be in English. User-facing text must be bilingual (uz/en). Responses to the owner must be in Uzbek.
Never commit secrets. Never hardcode database content.
